The values is a list of 1, 2, 3, 4, and 5.
The want is 4.
The aim is 3.
The left is 0.
The right is the last position of values.
Repeat while right minus left plus 1 is more than want.
The lowgap is item left of values minus aim.
Set lowgap to the absolute value of lowgap.
The highgap is item right of values minus aim.
Set highgap to the absolute value of highgap.
If lowgap is at most highgap, subtract 1 from right, otherwise add 1 to left.

The line is empty text.
For every spot from left to right.
If the length of line is more than 0, Place "," into line.
Place format whole number item spot of values as text into line.

Show line.
